    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Let the motherfuckin' beat build in this bitch",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "About that",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I thought that things like this get better with time",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But I still need you, why is that?",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You're the only image in my mind",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "So I still see you around",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I miss you, like every day",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Wanna be with you, but you're away",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I said I miss you, missin' you insane",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But if I got with you, could it feel the same?",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "The words don't ever seem to come out right",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But I still mean 'em, why is that?",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "It hurts my pride to tell you how I feel",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But I still need to, why is that?",
          "persona_id": "persona_beyonce_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
